@name     filter_env_multi
@alias    fte
@group    env
@c_name   skode_clause_filter_env_multi_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  configure multistage filter envelope from data
@doc
Configures multistage filter envelope from data buffer.
Usage: (0 0 100 1 50 .5) fte
@code
